---
description: Core architecture rules for the project
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use a modular monolith architecture.
- Use DDD where appropriate.
- Keep domain code independent of NestJS, MikroORM and SQS.
- Keep business rules and invariants inside domain entities and value objects.
- Use application use cases to orchestrate domain operations.
- Keep infrastructure concerns outside the domain.
- Prefer simple solutions over unnecessary abstractions.
- Do not introduce microservices.